prompts.zh_plain:
实现solve(payload)。text为由非负整数或闭区间组成的文本，separator默认为逗号，range_separator默认为连字符；分隔符保证非空且不同。返回升序整数列表，重复项保留；区间可正向或反向，均包含两端。首尾空白去除，空分段忽略；非法数值引发ValueError。仅使用标准库，内部函数数量和实现结构自由。
不得修改输入payload及其嵌套内容。测试输入符合已声明的字段与类型，明确要求的异常情形除外；不要求验证未声明的域外输入。
公开输入与直接返回值：
{"input": {"text": "1,3-5,3"}, "output": [1, 3, 3, 4, 5]}
{"input": {"text": "9:7;2", "separator": ";", "range_separator": ":"}, "output": [2, 7, 8, 9]}
只输出完整Python代码。

prompts.en_plain:
Implement solve(payload) in Python using only the standard library. payload["text"] contains nonnegative integers or inclusive integer ranges. payload.get("separator", ",") separates entries; payload.get("range_separator", "-") separates the endpoints. Both separators are nonempty and distinct. Return a globally SORTED ascending list of integers, preserving duplicates. Ranges include both endpoints whether the endpoints appear ascending or descending. Strip leading and trailing whitespace from the text and ignore empty segments. Invalid numeric strings raise ValueError. Do not modify payload or nested contents. Input fields and types follow the specification except explicitly required error cases. You may freely choose helper functions. Public examples show input and the exact direct function output:
{"input": {"text": "1,3-5,3"}, "output": [1, 3, 3, 4, 5]}
{"input": {"text": "9:7;2", "separator": ";", "range_separator": ":"}, "output": [2, 7, 8, 9]}
Output complete Python code only.
